  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]  [Fm]\n[Em]  [Ebdim7]\n[C]  [Dm7]\n[D7]  [G7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]Stars shining bright a-\n[Cdim]bove you [Dm7][G7]\n[C]Night breezes seem to\n[A7]whisper \"I love you\"\n[Dm7]Birds singing in the\n[D7b5]sycamore trees [Fm]\n[C]Dream a [Am7]little [Dadd9]dream of me\n[G7]\n[C]Say nightynight\n[Cdim]and kiss [Dm7]me [G7]\n[C]Just hold me tight and\n[A7]tell me you'll miss me\n[Dm7]While I'm alone and\n[D7b5]blue as can be [Fm]\n[C]Dream a [Am7]little [Dadd9]dream of [G7]me\n[C]  [Ab]  [Bbm7]  [Eb7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Ab]Stars [Bdim7]fading\n[Bbm7]but I linger on [Eb7]dear\n[Ab][Bdim7]Still craving your\n[Bbm7]kiss [Eb7]\n[Ab]I'm [Fm]longing\n[Bbm7]to linger [Eb7]till dawn dear\n[Ab]Just [Fm]saying\n[Dm7]this Give me a [G7]little kiss\n\n[Verse 3]\n[C]Sweet dreams\n[Cdim]till sunbeams [Dm7]find you [G7]\n[C]Sweet dreams that leave all\n[A7]worries behind you\n[Dm7]But in your dreams what-\n[D7b5]ever they be [Fm]\n[C]Dream a [Am7]little [Dadd9]dream of [G7]me\n[C]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Db]Stars [Bbm7]fading\n[Ebm7]but I linger [Ab7]on dear\n[Db/F]Still [Edim7]craving your\n[Ebm7]kiss [Ab7]\n[Db]I'm [Bbm7]longing to\n[Ebm7]linger till [Ab7]dawn dear\n[Db/F][Edim7]Just saying\n[Gm7]this [C7]\n[F]Sweet dreams, [Dm7]dreaming\n[Gm7]  [C7]\n[F]Gotta keep dreaming\n[D7]\n[Gm7]But in your dreams what-\n[Gdim7]ever they be [Bb6]You gotta\n[Am7]make me a promise,\n[Abdim7]promise to me You'll\n[Gm7]dream,\n[Gdim7]dream a little [C7]dream [C/E]of\n\n[Outro]\n[F]me [F/A][Bb][Bb/C]\n[F9]",
